    "title_question": "Match Scheduling Changes\nAs a captain, can I change our scheduled match date or time?",
    "question_answer": "As a captain, can I change our scheduled match date or time?\nYes. Under Rule 5.11, captains may mutually agree to reschedule a match to another time that day or to another day within the same week, subject to the Rule's scheduling and score-reporting requirements. Whenever captains agree to change a scheduled match date or time, they must also notify League Management at info@lwrpickleballclub.com of the new date and time."
